  "ruleText": "Puc 2001.03 Waiver of Rules. The commission shall consider and determine any request for a waiver from the provisions of these rules pursuant to Puc 203.01.\n\nSource. #12372, eff 11-1-17; ss by #14576, eff 5-13-26, EXPIRES: 5-13-36",
